expression: help
---
Use-case coverage, reservation and trace

Usage: instrukt specs <COMMAND>

Commands:
  coverage  How the project's tests stand against its feature specs' use cases
  reserve   Check a todo's planned bindings against the use cases other todos hold
  trace     Use cases joined with the structural graph (blueprint module)
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
